					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					2.3.4
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρια μεμολυσμένα
			ἄνθεσι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.6.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωλύω</span>
			.</div>
